  "intro": {
    "title": "Ich will…",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Wollen = want. Ich will Deutsch lernen. It's direct, so in shops use möchte instead. Careful: ich will does NOT mean 'I will'. The future is werden."
    ]
  },
